mlxflow 0.8; network
1. Template             "What changed in EU AI Act enforcement this
                        quarter?"
2. Web Search           top_k=5                      text -> [url]
3. <each fetch_one; on_error=skip ; [url] -> [text]>
     1. Web Fetch   (input:1)   as=markdown
4. Template     (3,1)   "Sources:\n{1}\n\nQ: {2}"
5. Answer               Qwen3 8B; "cite sources by number"
6. Save Text            research-brief.md
